  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A sample of a gas has volume <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"V\"></span> and contains <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"N\"></span> molecules, each of mass <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"m\"></span>. The average translational speed of the molecules is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"u\"></span>.</p>\n<p>Which expression is equivalent to the pressure of the gas?</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{3}\\frac{NV}{m}u^{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{3}\\frac{Nm}{V}u^{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{3}\\frac{N}{mV}u^{2}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{1}{3}\\frac{m}{NV}u^{2}\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
